	<BodyCopy
		title="About Ekim Brewing"
		bodyCopy="<p class='text-base text-gray-700 mb-2'>We are a small, locally owned craft brewery based in Hornsby, NSW. Raised in the area and with a combined 30 years of experience in the brewing industry, we are avid community members and supporters of local sports clubs, charity events, fire brigade, and fellow beer connoisseurs.</p><p class='text-base text-gray-700 mb-2'>Beer you love made by lovers of beer, when the time comes, we’ll still be making beers for Odin and his warriors in the great beer hall of Valhalla!</p><p class='text-base text-gray-700 mb-2'>We brew in small batches, unfiltered & unpasteurised. Brewed and packaged onsite each week and ready to order to ensure the absolute freshest beverage for your tastebud’s pleasure. With the highest quality ingredients and enthusiastic quality control protocols, we know firsthand that all Ekim beers would quench the thirst of the mightiest of battlers, brewed with rebellion in our hearts and pride in our bellies.</p><p class='text-base text-gray-700 mb-2'>We open up our Cellar Door on Friday & Saturday each week, with sit down tastings available as well as takeaway cans & growler fills. Our selection of tap and takeaway options varies week to week - To stay up to date with what's available at our cellar door, please follow us on Facebook & Instagram!</p></br>"
		link="https://ekimbrewing.com.au/"
		linkText="Ekim Brewing"
	/>
</MainLayout>
